    "reviewedBy": null
  },
  {
    "lineId": "idiom-shouzhudaitu-line-01",
    "asset": "audio/reading/idiom-shouzhudaitu-line-01.wav",
    "source": "macOS system speech; development demo",
    "voice": "Tingting",
    "speechText": "一个农夫在田里干活，看见兔子撞上树桩。",
    "textSha256": "dc034de5b1b1f52eb3b48b4e247c6d49cfb2727e535ed63665a73f0f074f45f3",
    "audioSha256": "ad8b2d14c00a37e837f0cafc9de095439fc141222e663f1fd0bd62c95c76fc43",
    "quality": "demo",
    "reviewedBy": null
  },
  {
    "lineId": "idiom-shouzhudaitu-line-02",
    "asset": "audio/reading/idiom-shouzhudaitu-line-02.wav",
    "source": "macOS system speech; development demo",
    "voice": "Tingting",
    "speechText": "农夫捡到了兔子，心里觉得非常高兴。",
    "textSha256": "f49c02491fd109ea9a80df2a5bc50be13374abe3c3bb9c4676e73f7f40dba0cd",
    "audioSha256": "06e4a0a1d5189053b515cfd37b4010aa9ec99779b9e722f71e51da79796f1df8",
    "quality": "demo",
    "reviewedBy": null
  },
  {
    "lineId": "idiom-shouzhudaitu-line-03",
    "asset": "audio/reading/idiom-shouzhudaitu-line-03.wav",
    "source": "macOS system speech; development demo",
    "voice": "Tingting",
    "speechText": "从此他不再种田，天天坐在树桩旁等待。",
    "textSha256": "90f876f6053e7b1143f6a97203348960d93bcabda2ae4c808a2ef482fea42336",
    "audioSha256": "c8b9b370f69f74f8189d239b2f25a792e77aab4ff3781194b5a27e521b74958a",
    "quality": "demo",
    "reviewedBy": null
  },
  {
    "lineId": "idiom-shouzhudaitu-line-04",
    "asset": "audio/reading/idiom-shouzhudaitu-line-04.wav",
    "source": "macOS system speech; development demo",
    "voice": "Tingting",
    "speechText": "后来兔子没有再来，田里的庄稼却荒废了。",
    "textSha256": "dff06140909433528dc6ef280cc88900404ee68103cc23724972336fdc3a66c9",
    "audioSha256": "1c878c12a300040a96b159858a2520c70c1cfff0b9a891cc3b7956c96c8e2594",
    "quality": "demo",
    "reviewedBy": null
  },
  {
    "lineId": "idiom-wangyangbulao-line-01",
    "asset": "audio/reading/idiom-wangyangbulao-line-01.wav",
    "source": "macOS system speech; development demo",
    "voice": "Tingting",
    "speechText": "一个人养了几只羊，羊圈破了一个大洞。",
    "textSha256": "0501e132ebc36f65608c452b4fa52d1639b0eef010a2f6fb962bdbb6ade9d887",
    "audioSha256": "9dbda6653e5b30006d5d03a5ad5cd3309f7f6085282da2a4c4836d8ecc4183e2",
    "quality": "demo",
    "reviewedBy": null
  },
  {
    "lineId": "idiom-wangyangbulao-line-02",
    "asset": "audio/reading/idiom-wangyangbulao-line-02.wav",
    "source": "macOS system speech; development demo",
    "voice": "Tingting",
    "speechText": "夜里狼从洞里钻进去，叼走了一只小羊。",
    "textSha256": "83e595e5a0f5f2a519b37e0f7b7045a16e34f02bb00ae3503fc7f4a5a555f38b",
    "audioSha256": "b39708962c1aee682318a7871efdce65cbe64d95e68117a0cb82c803201f7dea",
    "quality": "demo",
    "reviewedBy": null
  },
  {
    "lineId": "idiom-wangyangbulao-line-03",
    "asset": "audio/reading/idiom-wangyangbulao-line-03.wav",
    "source": "macOS system speech; development demo",
    "voice": "Tingting",
    "speechText": "邻居劝他修好羊圈，他这才认真补上洞。",
    "textSha256": "95fab8a0eb72b5c7afa17652b2a2461422c38af6222f18e0c44e743b0ec646b9",
    "audioSha256": "85f2ec0e9704be0307846262e46933bfe10c83c994e677e123db5a59fe61f591",
    "quality": "demo",
    "reviewedBy": null
  },
  {
    "lineId": "idiom-wangyangbulao-line-04",
    "asset": "audio/reading/idiom-wangyangbulao-line-04.wav",
    "source": "macOS system speech; development demo",
    "voice": "Tingting",
    "speechText": "羊圈修好了，剩下的羊也得到了保护。",
    "textSha256": "e74e63cbf01539a369b86ee77fcea9d4c6fd6b399b0774b77fd8fcefbb363526",
    "audioSha256": "3f7eab7e68ca5639644172e0bbabb06f7fc804eeca20f457af47badf39df7fe6",
    "quality": "demo",
    "reviewedBy": null
  },
  {
    "lineId": "idiom-huashetianzu-line-01",
    "asset": "audio/reading/idiom-huashetianzu-line-01.wav",
    "source": "macOS system speech; development demo",
    "voice": "Tingting",
    "speechText": "几个人商量比赛画蛇，先画完的人得到酒。",
    "textSha256": "ad20562174d581eb37d34db4d44b0d270695731a821a403fa96d200890792585",
    "audioSha256": "03f1a9cfa6f6ce0b48918f90d540132b32374e2fcd1de8e0d14bacd163426f5f",
    "quality": "demo",
    "reviewedBy": null
  },
  {
    "lineId": "idiom-huashetianzu-line-02",
    "asset": "audio/reading/idiom-huashetianzu-line-02.wav",
    "source": "macOS system speech; development demo",
    "voice": "Tingting",
    "speechText": "一个人很快画好了，见别人还在慢慢画。",
    "textSha256": "4aba7cd5f40e9cdc52493abeef2483a13f9740734d1b7e012c4b4a6922fc6cb3",
    "audioSha256": "f0d3207e6d13470a3d58c731d10e9a002428fd33d539d112270359b68d0c6e73",
    "quality": "demo",
    "reviewedBy": null
  },
  {
    "lineId": "idiom-huashetianzu-line-03",
    "asset": "audio/reading/idiom-huashetianzu-line-03.wav",
    "source": "macOS system speech; development demo",
    "voice": "Tingting",
    "speechText": "他得意地给蛇添上脚，想显示自己画得快。",
    "textSha256": "2e6ee0460f4612b58dfa2c0fdb93f46a5f019f2eee3eeed7543ea7276f42edb6",
    "audioSha256": "e2ac292f489da165c47f3db7dc70ebbadea528385d66910752153159d2f2addc",
    "quality": "demo",
    "reviewedBy": null
  },
  {
    "lineId": "idiom-huashetianzu-line-04",
    "asset": "audio/reading/idiom-huashetianzu-line-04.wav",
    "source": "macOS system speech; development demo",
    "voice": "Tingting",
    "speechText": "别人说蛇本来没有脚，他反而失去了酒。",
    "textSha256": "03e64d35a24de33abab0274173206c01d6a43e5a0e5bead65577c8c690268511",
    "audioSha256": "1ccbb74ac45347aca044ded3ae5f95b21ff01c1e2db764b65a28589f66cac63f",
    "quality": "demo",
    "reviewedBy": null
  },
  {
    "lineId": "idiom-yanerdaoling-line-01",
    "asset": "audio/reading/idiom-yanerdaoling-line-01.wav",
    "source": "macOS system speech; development demo",
    "voice": "Tingting",
    "speechText": "一个人想偷偷拿走铃铛，却怕铃声被听见。",
    "textSha256": "4ce2cc56032891d8617c70f5e79205147dc2a2d189362390156324a3b7a0e252",
    "audioSha256": "4608c586f4e581c9fcb47703c4f2e3ec66a13ce421ae8892ab7c84a6781d5e3a",
    "quality": "demo",
    "reviewedBy": null
  },
  {
    "lineId": "idiom-yanerdaoling-line-02",
    "asset": "audio/reading/idiom-yanerdaoling-line-02.wav",
    "source": "macOS system speech; development demo",
    "voice": "Tingting",
    "speechText": "他用双手捂住耳朵，以为别人也听不到。",
    "textSha256": "949b4cbf9eb766b35ca90fac60985095e8c52e8d42db5d5169b1f62c73331920",
    "audioSha256": "b419b755745f6d7729638277d9a514015db2bca16eb533f65b4b6bb922e9ec20",
    "quality": "demo",
    "reviewedBy": null
  },
  {
    "lineId": "idiom-yanerdaoling-line-03",
    "asset": "audio/reading/idiom-yanerdaoling-line-03.wav",
    "source": "macOS system speech; development demo",
    "voice": "Tingting",
    "speechText": "等他伸手去碰铃铛，清脆的铃声马上响起。",
    "textSha256": "a2b9074df6889602bd867dea68eb12c407ac719fdf804fa0088d0cbf72c7f007",
    "audioSha256": "083c7d3ee86b0c00a396ceef26ebd5e67960e6fa7674974eab32a03a16e8b00c",
    "quality": "demo",
    "reviewedBy": null
  },
  {
    "lineId": "idiom-yanerdaoling-line-04",
    "asset": "audio/reading/idiom-yanerdaoling-line-04.wav",
    "source": "macOS system speech; development demo",
    "voice": "Tingting",
    "speechText": "别人听到声音走过来，他的想法并不管用。",
    "textSha256": "b3c5f5b1a90bfa4d0f6991665ef6b5f72d0e8588cd96b67e18c7cfc03ab626c2",
    "audioSha256": "084e7ff520734ee64a98dc56c1617437e4dc7653b1cab62eaf4692d38fd914c7",
    "quality": "demo",
    "reviewedBy": null
  },
  {
    "lineId": "idiom-jingdizhiwa-line-01",
    "asset": "audio/reading/idiom-jingdizhiwa-line-01.wav",
    "source": "macOS system speech; development demo",
    "voice": "Tingting",
    "speechText": "一只青蛙住在井底，觉得自己的天地很大。",
    "textSha256": "2428dcfef87afb2b068e1cc4096d963c8c83a86be04bd705540398739b85df03",
    "audioSha256": "84f72a6eaae08cf3bc3213917039db6349c35d5ceaf94a90d79cf85a748d8584",
    "quality": "demo",
    "reviewedBy": null
  },
  {
    "lineId": "idiom-jingdizhiwa-line-02",
    "asset": "audio/reading/idiom-jingdizhiwa-line-02.wav",
    "source": "macOS system speech; development demo",
    "voice": "Tingting",
    "speechText": "一天海龟来到井边，说起辽阔的大海。",
    "textSha256": "4ea21f86e89cef9534aa7b79b92f0fd0de2e118fc6e43eb7619dff13160c8f43",
    "audioSha256": "1a201d7354c27f4ec3512a231a79c7f9c47d5bc217b32af81eefbd904f7a3ebe",
    "quality": "demo",
    "reviewedBy": null
  },
  {
    "lineId": "idiom-jingdizhiwa-line-03",
    "asset": "audio/reading/idiom-jingdizhiwa-line-03.wav",
    "source": "macOS system speech; development demo",
    "voice": "Tingting",
    "speechText": "青蛙听了很吃惊，原来井外还有那么多景色。",
    "textSha256": "b273e82058356347eca70416f50695f3543510c035c55765bccc3c0d8a7143e3",
    "audioSha256": "281d15a4f9573f05a6f549c50440edf5d7a437bd77796d5aa84d97bafcffcf37",
    "quality": "demo",
    "reviewedBy": null
  },
  {
    "lineId": "idiom-jingdizhiwa-line-04",
    "asset": "audio/reading/idiom-jingdizhiwa-line-04.wav",
    "source": "macOS system speech; development demo",
    "voice": "Tingting",
    "speechText": "它开始明白，自己看到的只是世界的一小部分。",
    "textSha256": "7a327aad992702ada31af33d7902f47e45f6fc8973e5b83107430a54f6933453",
    "audioSha256": "95317c9b2d418c90e6ce596b0f0c94a6569216a157600d88e28bf7febd246022",
    "quality": "demo",
    "reviewedBy": null
  },
  {
    "lineId": "idiom-kezhouqiujian-line-01",
    "asset": "audio/reading/idiom-kezhouqiujian-line-01.wav",
    "source": "macOS system speech; development demo",
    "voice": "Tingting",
    "speechText": "一个人乘船过河，不小心把剑掉进了水里。",
    "textSha256": "d3c3336d72f3c274a3b1d09ae1932b1aa78cf482c0c64f1fcb3dfd71e3c0b760",
    "audioSha256": "8e607003f77649100936dda1350627f29ebae14d9dcc49882590c45190e32f31",
    "quality": "demo",
    "reviewedBy": null
  },
  {
    "lineId": "idiom-kezhouqiujian-line-02",
    "asset": "audio/reading/idiom-kezhouqiujian-line-02.wav",
    "source": "macOS system speech; development demo",
    "voice": "Tingting",
    "speechText": "他急忙在船边刻记号，记住剑掉下的位置。",
    "textSha256": "39ce3a06d7f27695a0c21529385de737acac680f5b71b2941101b00fefc464e6",
    "audioSha256": "014a137db041cb51b2809d565d030ce035e655e9d0605b02a7654f4dac4d4e5b",
    "quality": "demo",
    "reviewedBy": null
  },
  {
    "lineId": "idiom-kezhouqiujian-line-03",
    "asset": "audio/reading/idiom-kezhouqiujian-line-03.wav",
    "source": "macOS system speech; development demo",
    "voice": "Tingting",
    "speechText": "船继续向前走，他却等船停下才准备找剑。",
    "textSha256": "694acd8d48500f1398aba2e8bfe61a74114cd5ee3300e8efec1923ce8f9a276e",
    "audioSha256": "56f10a9619fc461ca930e5f8f39df8957eabe793c1d515595e99ceaa1c429281",
    "quality": "demo",
    "reviewedBy": null
  },
  {
    "lineId": "idiom-kezhouqiujian-line-04",
    "asset": "audio/reading/idiom-kezhouqiujian-line-04.wav",
    "source": "macOS system speech; development demo",
    "voice": "Tingting",
    "speechText": "船的位置已经改变，照着记号找不到原来的剑。",
    "textSha256": "22443e0b2b182e15b482fc8a3b8a8c6495ff1a3ae0bdfbe376071a2164b267bd",
    "audioSha256": "45d08b5b13890bf3b0b6695cbc2566325d650543e26bc7f1aca2b57762c46e78",
    "quality": "demo",
    "reviewedBy": null
  },
  {
    "lineId": "idiom-bamiaozhuzhang-line-01",
    "asset": "audio/reading/idiom-bamiaozhuzhang-line-01.wav",
    "source": "macOS system speech; development demo",
    "voice": "Tingting",
    "speechText": "一个人每天看禾苗，总觉得禾苗长得太慢。",
    "textSha256": "2422604d123cd9414b5734ce7231bd912ac7f5c59231b3ea52cf91b37dcb1a35",
    "audioSha256": "2219ff10549570a80204993f26ba9f7f5c64ed76cfd0913dc6253a34257dd01c",
    "quality": "demo",
    "reviewedBy": null
  },
  {
    "lineId": "idiom-bamiaozhuzhang-line-02",
    "asset": "audio/reading/idiom-bamiaozhuzhang-line-02.wav",
    "source": "macOS system speech; development demo",
    "voice": "Tingting",
    "speechText": "他想帮助禾苗长高，就把每棵苗往上拔。",
    "textSha256": "d6f6da5c68551f860600061c25bd0ac2fc8b68426270337b656ea2a9e467437e",
    "audioSha256": "776c3cbeb65afc102f568721c6d7dbfeb55173d410d15ff0a41f1f297eb3f16f",
    "quality": "demo",
    "reviewedBy": null
  },
  {
    "lineId": "idiom-bamiaozhuzhang-line-03",
    "asset": "audio/reading/idiom-bamiaozhuzhang-line-03.wav",
    "source": "macOS system speech; development demo",
    "voice": "Tingting",
    "speechText": "忙了一整天以后，他高兴地回家告诉家人。",
    "textSha256": "02884a284e9da02ea7a47f968dc6eeed1ed419cf2050f4eb3517387effc43f67",
    "audioSha256": "097339b51c8a863c079ecb74b165128d8ec9325a7b176ba7cfe5dca6ac148fb1",
    "quality": "demo",
    "reviewedBy": null
  },
  {
    "lineId": "idiom-bamiaozhuzhang-line-04",
    "asset": "audio/reading/idiom-bamiaozhuzhang-line-04.wav",
    "source": "macOS system speech; development demo",
    "voice": "Tingting",
    "speechText": "家人去田里查看，发现禾苗已经开始枯萎。",
    "textSha256": "2a80e09edabd629cbb9da652b51c4a68ef91d7463b86be92f8d7f386876e1fcb",
    "audioSha256": "dc51939805c6d61efbe3a5bcb0b5d5c2c07a3e8e045cbb89377484cf89bf740f",
    "quality": "demo",
    "reviewedBy": null
  },
  {
    "lineId": "idiom-hujiahuawei-line-01",
    "asset": "audio/reading/idiom-hujiahuawei-line-01.wav",
    "source": "macOS system speech; development demo",
    "voice": "Tingting",
    "speechText": "老虎抓住一只狐狸，狐狸想了一个脱身办法。",
    "textSha256": "08a39095b7f37568d5e8361fdfb6f1151005f828b0d9c9396903e62ec4761eb6",
    "audioSha256": "f2ca862b50e883bcd422c9d4e4f8a9fd81bf7f94cf78d54885fb8f7c6fc94055",
    "quality": "demo",
    "reviewedBy": null
  },
  {
    "lineId": "idiom-hujiahuawei-line-02",
    "asset": "audio/reading/idiom-hujiahuawei-line-02.wav",
    "source": "macOS system speech; development demo",
    "voice": "Tingting",
    "speechText": "狐狸说大家都怕自己，请老虎跟着走一走。",
    "textSha256": "8f7c654e02af748b1bd5ac788ecc8ce4a81b66346b584c9376f095b27403f992",
    "audioSha256": "d7a21c24b5dd3648fd88d77eb6d5d37c16b299a33ff2bee88f062d212ba67683",
    "quality": "demo",
    "reviewedBy": null
  },
  {
    "lineId": "idiom-hujiahuawei-line-03",
    "asset": "audio/reading/idiom-hujiahuawei-line-03.wav",
    "source": "macOS system speech; development demo",
    "voice": "Tingting",
    "speechText": "森林里的动物看见老虎，纷纷跑开躲起来。",
    "textSha256": "cdd575fa81f78aff6b6c137afc15e20467df2e11cb4b9108ffe14a4dcaed0b85",
    "audioSha256": "733a3e7cfd909116e356a140e58aa4558d3cfd5668cd9bfbfdcdbab64dfdca28",
    "quality": "demo",
    "reviewedBy": null
  },
  {
    "lineId": "idiom-hujiahuawei-line-04",
    "asset": "audio/reading/idiom-hujiahuawei-line-04.wav",
    "source": "macOS system speech; development demo",
    "voice": "Tingting",
    "speechText": "老虎以为动物怕狐狸，其实大家怕的是老虎。",
    "textSha256": "a9967c86c163799f53a7f4e3fd27ca1676b251427b047a03c08a46ea0873a588",
    "audioSha256": "11f11c51ebeb1dee67ce8067bee327a761f874105e6ec2268b044df920e8a056",
    "quality": "demo",
    "reviewedBy": null
  },
  {
    "lineId": "idiom-zixiangmaodun-line-01",
    "asset": "audio/reading/idiom-zixiangmaodun-line-01.wav",
    "source": "macOS system speech; development demo",
    "voice": "Tingting",
    "speechText": "一个人卖矛又卖盾，先夸自己的盾特别坚固。",
    "textSha256": "9dbb238812779e3416e75df70d38e5ebb5f686e9a0bcbebffc537a0a52037507",
