    "source": "macOS system speech; development demo",
    "voice": "Tingting",
    "speechText": "愚公家门前有两座大山，每次出门都要绕路。",
    "textSha256": "a3caec41e4659ceaa5475d6f6cc4654b27ec5055146d4a604188c908461562ee",
