    "asset": "audio/reading/idiom-yugongyishan-line-02.wav",
    "source": "macOS system speech; development demo",
    "voice": "Tingting",
    "speechText": "他和家人商量以后，决定一起设法搬走大山。",
    "textSha256": "915ed83ccdfdcbfcf68e1e612614be743d95c44004e86c5ef195fb7e6d4ed32b",
