    "source": "macOS system speech; development demo",
    "voice": "Tingting",
    "speechText": "有人笑他做不到，他仍然带着大家坚持劳动。",
    "textSha256": "b6b967fdfde854bae0b2a42865ab71177cdb776c73a3d4e70c51b8463c61d6e7",
